    "text": "Bay Net\nwebsite\nMechanicsville\nLavender, Legacy And Lemonade: A Summer Weekend At Dixon Family Farm\nBy Martel Spears,\n12 hours agoMECHANICSVILLE, Md. — Nestled in the heart of St. Mary’s County along the banks of the Patuxent River, the Dixon Family Farm once tilled tobacco fields. But this past weekend, those same fields were blanketed in the scent and color of lavender as the annual Lavender Days Festival returned in full bloom.\n7",
